Notes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

* No third-party asset (image, font, audio, model) is bundled: the engine
  synthesises every visual and every sound procedurally at runtime.
* The third-party `vendor/` tree of THIS package is a **read-only attribution
  corpus**: verbatim copies of the upstream works named above, kept so that
  every path cited in `LICENSE.md` and in the source headers resolves inside
  the repository. It is **not** runtime code and **must not be imported**.
  See `vendor/README.md`.
* The `vendor/` corpus is also replicated in the vendored runtime copy under
  `apps/desktop/renderer/floating/vendor/avatar/vendor/`, so that the
  attribution chain is resolvable from either copy. Both copies are kept
  byte-identical by `scripts/sync-check.mjs` (SHA-256).
* "Mochi" / "Coucou" is the property of its respective authors. Ego does not
  redistribute those names, drawings, sounds or icons as product identity; the
  visual language shipped here is Ego's own (decision D4).
* `scripts/check-attribution.mjs` verifies, against
  `provenance.manifest.json`, that every derived file carries its canonical
  header with the right upstream, licence and origin path; that no native
  file carries one; that every `vendor/` path cited resolves; and that the
  package keeps a licence notice for every upstream in use.
